node_modules/
.env
.env.local
*.local
dist/
.next/
# TypeScript's incremental build cache (tsconfig.json sets "incremental": true).
# Derived output, rewritten by every typecheck and build — tracking it dirties the
# working tree after each gate run, which is exactly when the tree must be readable.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
reports/*.json
# Generated test reports. PARITY_REPORT.md is rewritten by the last step of `npm run
# gate`; the Playwright report by any `npx playwright test`. Neither carries reviewable
# evidence — the parity verdict regenerates identically and only its timestamps move,
# and the HTML report is one opaque blob describing whichever run happened last.
# Named file by file on purpose: `reports/*.md` would also swallow the hand-written
# phase reports, and reports/visual/ stays tracked as phase sign-off evidence.
reports/PARITY_REPORT.md
reports/playwright/
# Per-workbook demo state (seed snapshot). Fictional, but not source.
.demo/
